<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka finance sector stocks up on retail buying.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka finance sector stocks up on retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of firms listed in the finance and banking sector on the Colombo Stock Exchange, scored healthy gains in early Monday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>Seylan Merchant Bank was up 3.85 percent or 25 cents to 6.75 rupees, Hatton National Bank 3.45 percent or 10 rupees to 300, Vanik Inc Ltd 3.41 percent or 75 cents to 22.75.</p>
<p>&quot;Small investors are buying shares in the finance and banking sector, which have all showed good interim profits to June,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
